{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgEMYwr7bysP3eF7cjKLY","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"All six events from `docs/EVENTS.md` are now sent through `Analytics.capture`, and `flutter analyze` reports no issues. I didn't run the app. I didn't send the email or phone number as properties.\n\n**Registration screen**\n- **`registration_email_started` and `registration_phone_started`:** each fires once, on the first change in its field.\n- **`loan_amount_changed`:** fires when the user lets go of the slider, so once per drag instead of on every tick. I did this to keep volume down on the PostHog free tier.\n- **`terms_accepted`:** fires only when the box is ticked, not when it is unticked.\n- **`registration_continue_tapped`:** fires on Continue with the amount and terms, before navigating.\n\n**Offers screen**\n- **`offers_scrolled`:** fires once per visit, when the first vertical scroll ends, with the scroll position at that point. `OfferScreen` is now a `StatefulWidget` so it can remember it already fired.\n\nThe spec doesn't say whether the \"started\" and \"scrolled\" events should fire once or repeatedly. I chose once, since the funnel only needs the first occurrence.\n\n`flutter analyze` also edited `analysis_options.yaml` and generated `pubspec.lock` and `.dart_tool/`. I reverted and removed those, so only the two screens and `ANSWER.md` are changed. I haven't committed anything."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":274,"cache_read_input_tokens":25865,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":274},"output_tokens":461,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"91cc7441-4b79-4ca1-8ef8-759a16d7207f","uuid":"4ca6f750-9471-4bc